# Предложения
## Получить список предложений
GET http://localhost:4000/offers?limit=10 HTTP/1.1

###

## Получить премиальные предложения для города
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/premium?city=Amsterdam HTTP/1.1

###

## Получить детальную информацию о предложении
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/6329c3d6a04ab1061c6425ea HTTP/1.1

###

## Создать новое предложение
POST http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Beautiful & luxurious studio at great location",
  "description": "A quiet cozy and picturesque that hides behind a a river by the unique lightness of Amsterdam.",
  "city": "Amsterdam",
  "previewImage": "https://14.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/1.jpg",
  "images": [
    "https://14.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/1.jpg",
    "https://14.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/2.jpg",
    "https://14.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/3.jpg",
    "https://14.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/4.jpg",
    "https://14.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/5.jpg",
    "https://14.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/6.jpg"
  ],
  "isPremium": true,
  "type": "apartment",
  "bedrooms": 3,
  "maxAdults": 4,
  "price": 120,
  "goods": ["Breakfast", "Washer"],
  "authorId": "6329c3d6a04ab1061c6425ea",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 52.370216,
    "longitude": 4.895168
  }
}

###

## Обновить предложение
PATCH http://localhost:4000/offers/6329c3d6a04ab1061c6425ea HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 150,
  "isPremium": false
}

###

## Удалить предложение
DELETE http://localhost:4000/offers/6329c3d6a04ab1061c6425ea HTTP/1.1

###
